OL,3,GNEWSATwo seriously injured after M20
OL,4,Acrash involving more than 30 vehicles
OL,5,Ain Kent
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 30 vehicles were involved in
OL,8,Fa collision which left two people
OL,9,Fseriously injured on the M20 in Kent
OL,10,Flate on Saturday, police say.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to the scene at
OL,13,Faround 18:41 on the London-bound
OL,14,Fcarriageway between junctions eight and
OL,15,Fnine, near Hollingbourne, Maidstone.
OL,17,FEleven people were cared for by
OL,18,Fparamedics and two taken to hospital,
OL,19,FKent Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
