OL,5,Ain Kent
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn air ambulance crew, three fire
OL,8,Fengines and a "technical rescue unit"
OL,9,Fwere sent to the scene, where National
OL,10,FHighways said "thick fog" had been
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
